{"parse":{"title":"Light of Rationalisme","pageid":467731,"revid":2157047,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Light of Rationalisme</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/33/Talent_Light_of_Rationalisme.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122100\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Light of Rationalisme\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/33/Talent_Light_of_Rationalisme.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122100\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/33/Talent_Light_of_Rationalisme.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122100 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/33/Talent_Light_of_Rationalisme.png/revision/latest?cb=20260701122100 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Light of Rationalisme\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Light_of_Rationalisme.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Light of Rationalisme.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sandrone\" title=\"Sandrone\">Sandrone</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Jubilee_Passive\" title=\"Stellar Jubilee Passive\">Stellar Jubilee Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Passive_Talent\" title=\"Passive Talent\">Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Sandrone will enter the Radiance: Stellar Conduct state when she is inside a <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Polestar Field</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Polestar Field</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">When Stellar-Conduct is triggered, the surounding area will transform into a Polestar Field for a short period of time, and when inside a Polestar Field, certain characters will enter the Radiance: Stellar-Conduct state, when grants various skill buffs.</span></span></span>, or the Radiance: Stellar Swirl state for 8s after a nearby party member triggers a Stellar Swirl reaction.<br />When a party member triggers a <a href=\"/wiki/Superconduct\" title=\"Superconduct\">Superconduct</a> or Cryo <a href=\"/wiki/Swirl\" title=\"Swirl\">Swirl</a> reaction, it becomes a <a href=\"/wiki/Stellar-Conduct\" title=\"Stellar-Conduct\">Stellar-Conduct</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Swirl\" title=\"Stellar Swirl\">Stellar Swirl</a> reaction instead, and the Base DMG of the aforementioned reaction is also increased by 0.7% for every 100 points of Sandrone's ATK. A maximum increase of 14% can be obtained in this way.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Reaction_Enhancement\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elemental Reaction Enhancement\">Elemental Reaction Enhancement</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Reaction_Base_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elemental Reaction Base DMG Bonus\">Elemental Reaction Base DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar-Conduct_Enabler_and_Base_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stellar-Conduct Enabler and Base DMG Bonus\">Stellar-Conduct Enabler and Base DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Swirl_Enabler_and_Base_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stellar Swirl Enabler and Base DMG Bonus\">Stellar Swirl Enabler and Base DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Glimmer_Reaction_Enabling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stellar Glimmer Reaction Enabling\">Stellar Glimmer Reaction Enabling</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Light of Rationalisme</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Sandrone\" title=\"Sandrone\">Sandrone</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Jubilee_Passive\" title=\"Stellar Jubilee Passive\">Stellar Jubilee Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLight_of_Rationalisme%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Light of Rationalisme</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">唯理为光</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Wéi Lǐ Wéi Guāng</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Only Reason Becomes Light</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">唯理為光</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Wéi Lǐ Wéi Guāng</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">理論のみを光に</span><br /><small><i>Riron Nomi wo Hikari ni&#8205;&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"&lt;sup&gt;&#91;!&#93;&lt;/sup&gt;\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\"><sup>[!]</sup></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Assumed reading</span></span>&#8205;</i></small></td><td>Only Theory Becomes Light</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">이성의</span> <span la